#amidene and guanidine
[aD3]cC(~[ND1])~[ND1] 1 2 3 4 0.0 30.0
[a]cC(~[ND1])~[ND1] 1 2 3 4 0.0 30.0
*[ND2]~C(~[ND1])~[ND1] 1 2 3 4 0.0 30.0
[CD2][CD2][ND2]~C(~[ND1])~[ND1] 1 2 3 4 -70.0 70.0 90.0 -90.0 110.0 -110.0

